### Login Request (Success)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nagaraju@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login Request with Bad Credentials (Failure Test)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nagaraju@gmail.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Get Current Authenticated User Profile (Requires HttpOnly Cookie or Bearer Token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me

### Logout Request (Clears HttpOnly Cookie)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/logout